    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reborn in 1995: Rise from the Bottom</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181860/extras/6651dc57bb0a462df1532cf3d7cebaba.avif?t=1752378110\" width=289 height=236 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181860/extras/a11b241a9ecda43d2a3e3a3240ad44cc.avif?t=1752378110\" width=200 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewrite Your Destiny!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were a 54-year-old nobody\u2014drowning in debt, abandoned by everyone, even the last TV in your shabby room taken by loan sharks. But fate gives you a second chance when you wake up in 1995, armed with memories of the future and a burning desire for revenge. This time, you\u2019ll claw your way up from nothing and build a business empire of your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Broke to Billionaire</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the Cutthroat Business World \u2013 Flip goods, start companies, invest in tech\u2014every decision shapes your financial destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize the Golden Era \u2013 Ride the wave of the '90s economic boom, from street hustler to tech tycoon. The future is yours to claim!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal Realism \u2013 Manage cash flow, develop technology, outmaneuver rivals\u2014experience the ruthless highs and lows of entrepreneurship.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Multiple Lives, Forge Your Own Path</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonds &amp; Betrayals</strong> \u2013 Reconnect with childhood friends, lost loves, and new allies. Every choice alters relationships\u2014and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Self-Reinvention</strong> \u2013 Train your body, master skills, and upgrade stats. Wealth is just the beginning\u2014you\u2019re rebuilding your entire life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Endings</strong> \u2013 Will you become an untouchable mogul, or fade back into obscurity? Your actions write the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where Nostalgia Meets the Future</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'90s Throwback</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in the gritty, neon-lit streets of a transforming world.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change the Timeline</strong> \u2013 Exploit future knowledge to dominate the internet, real estate, and manufacturing before they boom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices. Your Legacy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014Will you rise as a legend, or die forgotten? The clock is ticking.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reborn in 1995: Rise from the Bottom</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181860/extras/6651dc57bb0a462df1532cf3d7cebaba.avif?t=1752378110\" width=289 height=236 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3181860/extras/a11b241a9ecda43d2a3e3a3240ad44cc.avif?t=1752378110\" width=200 height=236 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewrite Your Destiny!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were a 54-year-old nobody\u2014drowning in debt, abandoned by everyone, even the last TV in your shabby room taken by loan sharks. But fate gives you a second chance when you wake up in 1995, armed with memories of the future and a burning desire for revenge. This time, you\u2019ll claw your way up from nothing and build a business empire of your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Broke to Billionaire</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the Cutthroat Business World \u2013 Flip goods, start companies, invest in tech\u2014every decision shapes your financial destiny.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize the Golden Era \u2013 Ride the wave of the '90s economic boom, from street hustler to tech tycoon. The future is yours to claim!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal Realism \u2013 Manage cash flow, develop technology, outmaneuver rivals\u2014experience the ruthless highs and lows of entrepreneurship.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Multiple Lives, Forge Your Own Path</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bonds &amp; Betrayals</strong> \u2013 Reconnect with childhood friends, lost loves, and new allies. Every choice alters relationships\u2014and endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Self-Reinvention</strong> \u2013 Train your body, master skills, and upgrade stats. Wealth is just the beginning\u2014you\u2019re rebuilding your entire life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Endings</strong> \u2013 Will you become an untouchable mogul, or fade back into obscurity? Your actions write the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Where Nostalgia Meets the Future</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'90s Throwback</strong> \u2013 Immerse yourself in the gritty, neon-lit streets of a transforming world.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change the Timeline</strong> \u2013 Exploit future knowledge to dominate the internet, real estate, and manufacturing before they boom.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Choices. Your Legacy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014Will you rise as a legend, or die forgotten? The clock is ticking.</p>",
